    "code": "STABLE_MACHINE_READABLE_CODE",
    "what_failed": "A clear description of the failed operation or input.",
    "likely_fix": "A specific action the developer can take.",
    "request_id": "req_unique_identifier"
  }
}
```

Example — `422 Unprocessable Entity`:

```json
{
  "error": {
    "code": "INVALID_EMAIL",
    "what_failed": "The 'email' field is not a valid email address.",
    "likely_fix": "Provide an address in the format 'name@example.com' and retry the request.",
    "request_id": "req_01J8Y4K2H7M3P9"
  }
}
```

Never include stack traces, internal service names, infrastructure details, or other implementation internals.

